
# 📚 Shubh Books | Shubhang Mishra

Welcome to the official repository for **Shubh Books** – the portfolio and children's book collection by young author Shubhang Mishra (SpellBee Rank 2, Creative Writing Medalist).

🚀 **Live Website:** [shubhbooks.com](https://shubhbooks.com) 

## 📖 About
Explore achievements in writing, spelling, and music, alongside two published children's stories: *The Fox and the Cub* and *Rao's Expedition Book*.

## ✨ Features
- Aesthetic and interactive image carousel.
- Cross-domain embed support.
- Integrated Google Analytics 4 (GA4) with cross-origin iframe tracking.

## 🛠️ Development
To run this project locally:
```sh
git clone https://github.com/14008-design/shubhbooks.git
cd shubhbooks
npm install
npm run dev
